## ⚙ Getting Started

### Clone the repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/camply.git
```

### Install dependencies

```bash
npm install
```

### Configure environment variables

Create a `.env` file and add the required Supabase configuration.

```env
SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
```

### Start development

Student App

```bash
npx expo start
```

Admin Dashboard

```bash
npm run dev
```

