## 💡 Challenges Solved

During development I focused on solving several real-world engineering problems:

* Multi-tenant architecture
* Shared backend for multiple institutions
* Secure authentication
* Scalable database design
* Mobile-first user experience
* Separation between student, university admin, and platform administrator roles

